@startuml uml-pacotes-clean
!include _uml.iuml
title Clean Architecture + Vertical Slice — Diagrama de Pacotes e Regra de Dependência (api/src)

package "Frameworks & Drivers" as FD #F0F0F0 {
  rectangle "features/*/*.function.js" as FN
  rectangle "bootstrap (Composition Root)" as BOOT
  rectangle "@azure/functions · mongodb · @azure/service-bus" as LIBS
}
package "Interface Adapters" as IA #E3EEFB {
  rectangle "features/*/*.handler.js" as HD
  rectangle "shared/http" as SH
  rectangle "infrastructure (persistence · messaging · notifications · time)" as INF
}
package "Application (Use Cases)" as APP #CFE2F8 {
  rectangle "features/*/*UseCase.js" as UC
}
package "Entities (Domain)" as DOM #B7D3F2 {
  rectangle "domain (Delivery · DeliveryStatus · DeliveryEvents · errors · ports)" as D
}

FN --> HD
FN --> BOOT
HD --> UC
HD --> SH
SH --> D
UC --> D
INF --> D
BOOT --> INF
BOOT --> UC

note right of DOM
  Regra de dependência: as setas apontam sempre
  para dentro. O domínio não depende de nenhum
  pacote externo (verificado por teste de arquitetura).
end note

note bottom of FD
  Vertical Slice: cada funcionalidade é uma pasta em features/
  (createDelivery, searchDeliveries, updateDelivery, deleteDelivery,
  hello, processDeliveryEvent) contendo function + handler + use case.
  Fatias não importam umas às outras.
end note
@enduml
